cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite it.
title: contract-quaternion-interpolation, property checks of Godot's quaternion interpolation
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 Float model of Godot's spherical cubic, cubic-in-time and makima
  quaternion interpolation, before godot PR 124915, as that PR was written, and
  with two fixes. Plausible generates inputs and checks ten properties on each
  model. The fixed model must hold them all; the other two must fail, so the
  checks are shown to be able to fail. The run also writes a Godot doctest file
  of the failing inputs.
authors:
  - given-names: K. S. Ernest
    family-names: Lee
    alias: iFire
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/contract-quaternion-interpolation
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Plausible
  - property-based testing
  - quaternion
  - Godot
